{"lines":[{"x":0.091164759600520423,"y":0.041731620443271167,"w":0.12058310190836588,"c":1,"h":0.016827456750602376,"t":"Audioscripts"},{"x":0.091262134586010665,"t":"butter and cheese in the country. And this morning, a specialist cheesemaker will be giving","y":0.091569767536311408,"h":0.015988371899566256,"c":1,"w":0.71844660441080732},{"x":0.091091158312602019,"t":"demonstrations of how it's produced. You may even get to try some.","y":0.1050349787425271,"w":0.54016255696614579,"h":0.020028552236586838,"c":1},{"x":0.091262135312277434,"y":0.13226744156780756,"w":0.68737864176432295,"h":0.014534884301301454,"t":"After that, you can go in two directions. To the right is a staircase that takes you up to a","c":1},{"t":"landing from where you can look down on the galleries. To the left is a room called A Year on","x":0.089320391464054114,"y":0.14825581404767907,"c":1,"w":0.73203882853190105,"h":0.015988371899566145},{"t":"the Farm. There's lots of seating here as sometimes we use the room for school visits, so it's","x":0.093148109306497986,"h":0.016593159470602803,"c":1,"y":0.16377533880275141,"w":0.73020380655924477},{"h":0.014641744548286706,"t":"a good place to stop for a rest. If you're feeling competitive, you can take our memory test in","y":0.18161993787224229,"w":0.73009709676106771,"x":0.091262131139080035,"c":1},{"h":0.015988371899566145,"x":0.091262134209031745,"t":"which you answer questions about things you've seen in the museum.","y":0.19622093012943198,"w":0.55533981323242188,"c":1},{"w":0.70873784383138017,"y":0.22087227421009681,"t":"The next area's called Wagon Walk. This contains farm carts from nearly every part of the","x":0.09126214594420276,"h":0.016199376947040545,"c":1},{"w":0.71262135823567707,"h":0.016040897072289839,"c":1,"t":"country. It's surprising how much regional variation there was. Beside the carts are display","x":0.091262136360551652,"y":0.23691860474144444},{"c":1,"t":"boards with information about each one. The carts are old and fragile, so we ask you to keep","w":0.73592234293619785,"y":0.25420560751587007,"h":0.016199376947040434,"x":0.091262129400563385},{"h":0.014534884301301454,"c":1,"y":0.27034883691512357,"x":0.089320399341324574,"w":0.53398056030273433,"t":"your children close to you and ensure they don't climb on the carts."},{"w":0.73592234293619785,"y":0.29501557625292085,"c":1,"x":0.0912621294027854,"t":"From Wagon Walk, you can either make your way back to reception or go out into the garden","h":0.014641744548286595},{"w":0.73592234293619785,"y":0.31090342652644143,"t":"- or even go back to take another look in the galleries. In the far corner of the garden is Bees","x":0.091262129425715932,"h":0.013224480530925953,"c":1},{"h":0.019253454475759324,"c":1,"x":0.089267239753966596,"t":"are Magic, but we're redeveloping this area so you can't visit that at the moment. You can still","w":0.73991261800130215,"y":0.32400003299956548},{"w":0.28155339558919273,"h":0.016020973894826374,"y":0.34299065390967065,"t":"buy our honey in the shop, though.","c":1,"x":0.089320389484163154},{"c":1,"x":0.091188889385365235,"w":0.69528035481770845,"h":0.019054490680635139,"t":"Finally, there's The Pond, which contains all kinds of interesting wildlife. There are baby","y":0.36599147484342054},{"h":0.014534884301301343,"y":0.38372092994032547,"x":0.089320396644221769,"c":1,"t":"ducks that are only a few days old, as well as tiny frogs. The Pond isn't deep and there's a","w":0.71456309000651042},{"h":0.014641744548286595,"c":1,"t":"fence around it, so it's perfectly safe for children.","y":0.39968847330898072,"x":0.087378639312560194,"w":0.39029126485188798},{"y":0.45754994782664138,"w":0.10502978006998696,"c":1,"x":0.091174430256093855,"h":0.018039639196663293,"t":"PART 3"},{"w":0.052427183787028001,"x":0.089320388591922886,"h":0.011627906728013726,"t":"TUTOR:","c":1,"y":0.49127906986855119},{"t":"SEB.","w":0.036893202463785801,"h":0.010174419129748924,"c":1,"y":0.54069767412779346,"x":0.087378641394860068},{"y":0.58720930207915389,"w":0.029126211802164709,"c":1,"h":0.013081395514657479,"t":"LIA:","x":0.087378641841636101},{"t":"SEB:","x":0.089320389202751468,"h":0.011627906728013615,"y":0.63662790700421024,"c":1,"w":0.034951454798380535},{"h":0.011627906728013615,"c":1,"t":"LIA:","w":0.029126211802164709,"y":0.70203488380376722,"x":0.08737864158158061},{"y":0.73401162799714215,"c":1,"w":0.034951454798380535,"x":0.089320389014287752,"t":"SEB:","h":0.011627906728013615},{"y":0.78197674416506291,"c":1,"w":0.029126211802164709,"t":"LIA:","h":0.011627906728013615,"x":0.087378641841636101},{"w":0.034951454798380535,"c":1,"t":"SEB:","y":0.81395348835110926,"h":0.011627906728013726,"x":0.089320389299838848},{"c":1,"w":0.029126211802164709,"t":"LIA:","y":0.82994186044413265,"h":0.011627906728013615,"x":0.087378641841636101},{"c":1,"t":"SEB:","x":0.087378641389466313,"w":0.036893202463785815,"y":0.84738372102039816,"h":0.011627906728013615},{"c":1,"x":0.087378641768820556,"w":0.029126211802164709,"t":"LIA:","y":0.87936046512436528,"h":0.011627906728013726},{"w":0.62330098470052087,"y":0.48971962601409869,"h":0.013187350810873855,"t":"So now I want you to discuss the lesson we've just been watching on the video","c":1,"x":0.18834950754918481},{"c":1,"x":0.18640776615444735,"w":0.63106796264648446,"t":"and think about the ways in which origami can be a useful educational tool. Can","y":0.50581395358240899,"h":0.015992900218547601},{"w":0.39223302205403643,"h":0.015988371899566145,"x":0.18446601310458913,"c":1,"y":0.52180232567072182,"t":"you all work with the person sitting next to you ..."},{"t":"I had no idea that such a simple thing like folding squares of paper to make the","y":0.53769470405912045,"x":0.18446602812791335,"w":0.62718444824218755,"h":0.016199376947040545,"c":1},{"h":0.013173766448118962,"c":1,"x":0.18640776615018345,"y":0.555140187120578,"w":0.63106796264648435,"t":"shape of something like a bird could be such an amazing tool. It's made me see"},{"w":0.22524271647135419,"h":0.015988371899566145,"x":0.18640776787049929,"c":1,"t":"origami in a whole new light.","y":0.56976744194868922},{"c":1,"h":0.014659856635833357,"x":0.18446602177524957,"y":0.58720930203252331,"t":"Iknow. It was interesting to see the educational skills the children were","w":0.56310679117838536},{"w":0.61747573852539062,"y":0.60311526478113053,"c":1,"t":"developing by doing origami. On the video you could see them really listening","h":0.014641744548286595,"x":0.18640776169723902},{"t":"hard to make sure they did all the steps in the right order to make the bird.","h":0.017666016338027557,"c":1,"y":0.61755710897210614,"x":0.18436159018267839,"w":0.59051432291666672},{"t":"That's right. In this lesson they were working individually but it would also be","w":0.60388351440429688,"x":0.18640775726194836,"h":0.015988371899566256,"c":1,"y":0.63517441869874136},{"c":1,"x":0.18446602976427642,"w":0.6213592020670573,"h":0.016199376947040545,"t":"interesting to see if the children could work out how to make something simple","y":0.65109034243726416},{"t":"without being given any direction. That would help with building teamwork as","y":0.6671511628803517,"h":0.016026407164576595,"x":0.18446602537790749,"c":1,"w":0.60776697794596357},{"y":0.69906542030091412,"c":1,"x":0.18640776143309759,"w":0.61747573852539062,"t":"Yes, but much more of a challenge. One thing that really stood out for me was","h":0.016199376947040434},{"y":0.71651090316013655,"w":0.56504852294921881,"c":1,"h":0.014641744548286595,"t":"that the children were all having fun while being taught something new.","x":0.18446602962790828},{"w":0.61747573852539062,"h":0.016039990933141901,"t":"Which is a key aim of any lesson with this age group. And although these kids","c":1,"x":0.18446601413186139,"y":0.73255813962899119},{"h":0.017709768895419642,"c":1,"t":"had no problems with folding the paper, with younger children you could do","x":0.18438817985187786,"y":0.7478762974719747,"w":0.59626027425130212},{"w":0.32038836161295581,"c":1,"h":0.014641744548286595,"x":0.18640776078795709,"t":"origami to help practise fine motor skills.","y":0.76448598102455168},{"t":"Absolutely. Shall we talk about the individual children we saw on the video? I","y":0.78037383188724141,"h":0.013230819345634637,"x":0.18640777257470528,"c":1,"w":0.60776697794596346},{"w":0.39239707946777341,"c":1,"y":0.79581852064177261,"x":0.1843961861389361,"t":"wrote all their names down and took some notes.","h":0.015265258598921805},{"t":"Yes, I did too.","y":0.81188915771118197,"x":0.18431623565794628,"w":0.11292092641194665,"h":0.017210056625794112,"c":1},{"w":0.23883494059244792,"x":0.18640777232181605,"t":"OK, good. Let's start with Sid.","y":0.82834890994067389,"h":0.016199376947040545,"c":1},{"x":0.1844660264778876,"w":0.63300969441731769,"y":0.8457943925899184,"t":"He was interesting because before they started doing the origami, he was being","h":0.016199376947040545,"c":1},{"t":"quite disruptive.","x":0.18446602098038406,"y":0.86191860493864991,"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1,"w":0.13009708404541015},{"y":0.87788161979518997,"t":"Yes. He really benefited from having to use his hands - it helped him to settle","w":0.61359222412109382,"h":0.01601372894096964,"c":1,"x":0.18446602369699708},{"w":0.23910860697428385,"h":0.01462468892985791,"c":1,"x":0.18434538659864305,"t":"down and start concentrating.","y":0.89393416146874871},{"y":0.95930232546001037,"c":1,"w":0.036893202463785815,"h":0.01308139551465759,"x":0.089320388962281852,"t":"116"},{"c":1,"t":"Q16","w":0.038834950129191026,"y":0.091569767703114757,"x":0.85436893261101854,"h":0.014534883112922281},{"c":1,"t":"Q17","x":0.85436893265699609,"h":0.013081395514657479,"y":0.18168604639238051,"w":0.036893202463785801},{"x":0.85436893265699609,"w":0.036893202463785801,"y":0.32703488360168287,"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1,"t":"Q19"},{"x":0.85436893266302438,"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1,"t":"Q20","y":0.36773255801815008,"w":0.036893202463785801},{"t":"Q21\/22","c":1,"y":0.60254686437913829,"w":0.062604707082112632,"x":0.85413453956659657,"h":0.014383015380098785},{"c":1,"y":0.71656976733639621,"x":0.85436893046365947,"w":0.062135925292968741,"t":"Q21\/22","h":0.01308139551465759},{"c":1,"x":0.85436893271003289,"t":"Q23","w":0.034951454798380577,"h":0.01308139551465759,"y":0.87790697662039663}],"w":2400,"h":3209}